{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾Arc B580顯卡可能即將停產，因為該公司將優先發展利潤更高的工作站和AI推理顯卡。這一傳聞與近期有關英偉達將GB202晶片的生產線從RTX 5090轉移的報道相呼應，儘管兩家公司均未證實這一消息。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584914.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T18:21:16.169456+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T18:00:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T18:18:16.948439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T18:18:16.948439+00:00","content_hash":"73514f02e6c9df107009248b77f3822ca987f2e419280939a35cfa410ba11b27","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}